{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_1","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 -B - <<'PY'\nimport json,pathlib\nbase=pathlib.Path('data/accounting-master/runs/20261002T221346-d54a6552/P04')\nfor rel in ['approved-plan.json','execution-2/repair-2.response.json','execution-2/checks.json']:\n p=base/rel\n print(str(p));print(json.dumps(json.loads(p.read_text()),indent=2))\nprint('STRUCTURED REVIEW RECORDS')\nfor p in base.rglob('*.json'):\n if ('review_result' in p.name or 'review' in p.name) and 'response' in p.name: print(str(p))\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"data/accounting-master/runs/20261002T221346-d54a6552/P04/approved-plan.json\n{\n  \"plan\": {\n    \"assumptions\": [\n      \"This revision preserves the prior numerical plan and addresses the review's conditional-alternative finding. Planning is read-only; no files were changed or implementation tests run.\",\n      \"Use existing Python, fractions.Fraction and Z3, recording actual versions during implementation. Exact arithmetic is required by the contract; Z3 remains an implementation choice checked by independent oracles.\",\n      \"Support explicit template registries, finite slots, context-compatible observations and rational-linear mappings. Preserve accepted P03 code, schemas and frozen evidence through a separate versioned adapter/result format.\",\n      \"Requests explicitly supply evidence view, query scope, integer bounds, rounding convention/stage and resource budgets. Unknown conventions remain unresolved; fixture sizes and budgets are engineering choices, not production defaults.\",\n      \"Implementation requires an authorised writable environment and an existing supervisor execution-entry inventory. The recovery record currently supplies no inventory path.\"\n    ],\n    \"checks\": [\n      \"Completed read-only verification: all required P04 deliverables, tests and previously proposed implementation modules remain absent. Read the full structured review and prior plan, including content omitted from recovery excerpts.\",\n      \"Confirmed the review finding against source: P03 emits choice_group=null, retains separate parent constraints, and describes allFixed/allFloating as non-exhaustive conditional views.\",\n      \"Run python3 -B -m unittest discover -s tests -p 'test_accounting_p04.py' -v. Require every catalogued obligation to execute without failures, errors, skips, duplicate IDs or missing observations.\",\n      \"Compare complete feasible assignment sets against an independent Fraction enumerator replaying original templates and observations without production lowering or Z3. Perturb identifiers, declaration order, openings, observations, rates, coefficients and slot limits.\",\n      \"Through the actual P03 compiler and P04 adapter, verify alpha=1/2 remains feasible in the parent; allFixed admits only alpha=1 within its query; subsequent parent queries remain unchanged. Add overlapping views alpha<=3/4 and alpha>=1/4: their intersection survives, declaration order preserves feasibility, and view labels neither multiply coverage cells nor create weights. Contradictory view selection makes only that conditional query infeasible.\",\n      \"Check exact debt bounds [5,7]; rounded-case infimum 199/40 attained and supremum 1407/200 unattained; negative ties, half-even parity, posting quantisation, integer gaps, empty strict domains, constant and unbounded objectives. Check feasibility before closed-relaxation bounds.\",\n      \"Test linked choices across accounts/dates, shared observation identity, incompatible marginal extrema, source-labelled conflicts, unresolved obligations, unsupported nonlinear operations, zero-work budgets and interruption after a completed cell. Inject backend Unknown deterministically, avoiding timing-dependent assertions.\",\n      \"Test exact posterior weights 3/11 and 8/11, repeated-information rejection, zero-probability conditioning, unweighted-summary rejection and retained unresolved/default mass. Test all six uncertainty admissions and grouping invalidation after rate, maturity, scenario or horizon changes.\",\n      \"Run python3 -B -m unittest discover -s tests -p 'test_accounting_p03.py' -v without regenerating accepted P03 outputs.\",\n      \"Run python3 -B scripts/check_accounting_p04.py --output-dir data/accounting-master/deliverables/P04 --execution-inventory <existing supervisor inventory>. Resolve the placeholder before execution; require successful checks, matching hashes, complete observations and unchanged protected inputs.\"\n    ],\n    \"evidence\": [\n      \"data/accounting-master/runs/20261002T221346-d54a6552/P04/plan-1.recovery.json\",\n      \"data/accounting-master/runs/20261002T221346-d54a6552/P04/plan-0.response.json\",\n      \"data/accounting-master/runs/20261002T221346-d54a6552/P04/review_plan-0.response.json\",\n      \"data/accounting-master/runs/20261002T221346-d54a6552/P04/review_plan-0.process.json\",\n      \"docs/plans/accounting-mission-requirements.md\",\n      \"docs/design/spec/core-contract.md\",\n      \"docs/design/spec/core0-lowering-profile-v1.md\",\n      \"docs/design/chapters/06-language.tex\",\n      \"scripts/core0_ir_v1.py\",\n      \"scripts/check_repair_conformance.py\",\n      \"tests/test_accounting_p03.py\",\n      \"docs/design/fixtures/borrowing.acc\",\n      \"docs/design/fixtures/borrowings.json\",\n      \"docs/design/fixtures/northstar.json\"\n    ],\n    \"issues\": [],\n    \"next_actions\": [\n      \"Submit this focused revision for plan review.\",\n      \"After acceptance, implement the declared files in the authorised writable environment with supervisor inventory provenance.\",\n      \"Generate actual conformance and result deliverables, execute the listed checks, and submit for independent result review.\"\n    ],\n    \"residuals\": [\n      \"No P04 implementation or acceptance evidence exists yet; the required conformance.json, result.md and tests/test_accounting_p04.py are absent.\",\n      \"The execution-entry inventory must be supplied by the supervisor before implementation protection checks can pass.\",\n      \"General disclosure interpretation, template discovery, arbitrary-history completeness, nonlinear solving, continuous probabilistic inference, unbounded integer search and general aggregation equivalence remain unsupported.\",\n      \"Selected numerical consistency and synthetic admission tests establish neither full accounting validity nor empirical forecast validity or human acceptance.\",\n      \"MC01\\u2013MC35 and G1\\u2013G18 retain their wider obligations. This slice supplies bounded evidence for MC08\\u2013MC12, MC18 and MC26 without claiming global closure.\"\n    ],\n    \"steps\": [\n      \"1. Record the execution contract in new docs/design/spec/reconstruction-profile-v1.md and docs/design/fixtures/p04-reconstruction-cases-v1.json; maintain data/accounting-master/deliverables/P04/progress.md. Question: do declared inputs generate the correct joint family within the declared scope? Comparators: independent exact enumeration and algebra. Passing requires matching feasible sets, numerical semantics, coverage and provenance; solver success alone is insufficient. Record material defaults with provenance, justification, failure mode, early diagnostic and status. Missing dependencies/protection evidence or changed protected inputs stop acceptance; failed cases trigger repair. Skeptical audit: the prior plan's material flaw was treating named views as potential search choices. The revised separation below removes that ambiguity; no speed ranking, weak comparator or proxy promotion is proposed.\",\n      \"2. Add scripts/reconstruction_v1.py with versioned inputs/results and explicit validation of registry templates, openings, slots, contextual observations, admissions, mappings and budgets. Distinguish three records: parent-family constraints P; named conditional predicates A_i; genuine finite choices. The P03 adapter consumes validated IR plus explicit template bindings, preserves provenance, and maps choice_group=null alternatives to named views only. Parent queries use P; selecting a view uses P AND A_i without mutating P. Multiple-view intersection or union requires an explicit query operator. Neither exclusivity, exhaustiveness nor weights follow from labels.\",\n      \"3. Construct constraints from inputs. Instantiate each declared slot once with activation and nonnegative amount; inactive implies zero. Derive dated roll-forwards and report expressions from posting incidence and economic-state coefficients. Share symbols by economic IDs and attach each accepted observation domain once with source/assumption IDs. Keep view predicates outside parent constraints and the choice enumeration. Genuine choice guards apply jointly across accounts/dates. For overlapping Boolean guards, create disjoint decision-prefix cells, preserving their exact union; verify disjointness and coverage or leave coverage uncertified. Preserve unmatched obligations and explicit scope exclusions.\",\n      \"4. Add scripts/rational_solver_v1.py. Classify expressions before solving; enumerate genuine finite choices and bounded integer assignments lazily while retaining continuous regions symbolically. Implement F+V=D amount parameterisation with documented equivalence conditions. Rewrite constant fraction restrictions only under proved denominator-sign conditions; P03's exact positive principal permits alpha=F/D. Unknown products, unsupported functions and unbounded integer domains return UnsupportedFragment/Unknown with the original expression, never Infeasible.\",\n      \"5. Implement explicit rounding and bound semantics. Preserve open/closed disclosure endpoints; support exact half-even posting quantisation and bounded minor-unit symbolic cases without continuous relaxation of integers. Establish feasibility on original constraints first. For each feasible convex linear cell, optimise its closed relaxation, certify no better value, and test endpoint attainment against the original strict constraints. Record rational bounds, witnesses, proof queries, scope and rounding stage. Distinguish Unbounded from Unknown; unknown optimisation/proof/attainment checks leave the affected conclusion uncertified. Recheck source-labelled unsatisfiable cores without claiming minimality.\",\n      \"6. Preserve joint queries and unfinished work. Coverage counts genuine choice/partition/integer cells, never conditional-view labels; a parent with no genuine choices has one symbolic cell despite multiple views. Each conditional query gets separate scope and coverage metadata. Record total, completed, feasible, infeasible and unresolved cells with a defined counting convention. Enforce slot, formula-size, integer-assignment, cell, solver-resource and elapsed-time limits; retain unvisited regions compactly. Feasible witnesses may coexist with PartialSearch. Infeasible requires all relevant cells proved infeasible; ExactWithinScope additionally requires all applicable obligations resolved or explicitly outside scope. Partial-cell extrema remain explored bounds. Preserve formulas and branch identities, testing joint output tuples against shared constraints.\",\n      \"7. Retain bounded uncertainty, probability and resolution operations. Validate ExtractionReading, HistoricalFact, AccountingElection, MeasurementEstimate, BehaviourPolicy and FutureInnovation against required admission/provenance fields. Separate factual constraints, hypothetical stress and likelihood updates. Finite probabilities require an explicit joint measure on disjoint economic hypotheses; overlapping views are events over that measure, not additional atoms. Preserve unresolved/default mass and reject summaries requiring unavailable outcomes. Permit documented additive grouping only with retained contract memory, matching rate/reset/maturity/hedge keys and checked transition/report preservation for the requested scenario and horizon. Changed requirements force revalidation; approximate or unproved grouping remains unsupported.\",\n      \"8. Implement tests/test_accounting_p04.py and independent oracles using small known-history fixtures plus selected immutable Northstar and borrowing inputs. Independently replay templates to generate observations, withholding hidden histories and authored expected constraints from production reconstruction. Compare complete finite sets and analytic continuous bounds. Include the parent/interior, isolated conditional-query and overlapping-view integration assertions listed in checks; endpoint extrema alone cannot establish preservation of the parent family. Tie every fixture obligation to executed assertions and include metamorphic input changes.\",\n      \"9. Add scripts/check_accounting_p04.py and generate data/accounting-master/deliverables/P04/conformance.json and result.md. Preserve actual input/source/test hashes, generated constraints, witnesses/conflicts, endpoint results, parent/view query identities, partition coverage, oracle comparisons and test outcomes. Include the decision table, strongest alternative explanation, exclusions and unfinished work. Record command, interpreter/package versions, CPU-only execution, deterministic seed status, wall time, reviewed-plan reference, execution inventory and every changed file. Compare protected-file hashes before/after; avoid importing legacy scripts with output-writing side effects. Update progress after meaningful edits and finish checks before the reserved response interval.\"\n    ],\n    \"summary\": \"Revised P04 plan preserves P03's parent continuous family and overlapping conditional views. Only genuine finite choices or justified exhaustive partitions create search cells; targeted integration tests detect loss of unnamed interior histories.\",\n    \"verdict\": \"PLAN\"\n  },\n  \"review\": {\n    \"assumptions\": [\n      \"Approval covers the bounded P04 implementation plan, not implementation correctness or phase acceptance.\",\n      \"Implementation requires an authorised writable environment and a supervisor-provided execution inventory before protection checks can pass.\"\n    ],\n    \"checks\": [\n      \"Read the recovery snapshot, complete prior review, revised structured plan and successful planner process record; verified required P04 deliverables and implementation modules remain absent.\",\n      \"Verified that P03 emits choice_group=null for named alternatives and retains parent constraints separately. Chapter 6 explicitly preserves every alpha in [0,1].\",\n      \"Confirmed the revision addresses every prior finding: independent parent and conditional queries, explicit intersection/union, overlapping views, interior feasibility, query isolation and coverage independent of view labels.\",\n      \"Audited baselines and comparison fairness: independent Fraction enumeration and analytic bounds test generated constraints against original inputs; authored final answers and solver success are insufficient.\",\n      \"Audited proxy promotion and stopping rules: unknown proofs, unfinished cells and unresolved obligations prevent exact certification; failed cases trigger repair.\",\n      \"Audited hidden defaults, stale context and environment: request-level budgets, rounding, integer bounds and scope are explicit; Z3 4.16.0 is available; missing execution inventory is acknowledged.\",\n      \"Confirmed proposed artifacts preserve generated constraints, provenance, witnesses, conflicts, endpoint attainment, coverage and actual test outcomes. No files were changed or implementation tests run.\"\n    ],\n    \"evidence\": [\n      \"data/accounting-master/runs/20261002T221346-d54a6552/P04/review_plan-1.recovery.json\",\n      \"data/accounting-master/runs/20261002T221346-d54a6552/P04/review_plan-0.response.json\",\n      \"data/accounting-master/runs/20261002T221346-d54a6552/P04/plan-1.response.json\",\n      \"data/accounting-master/runs/20261002T221346-d54a6552/P04/plan-1.process.json\",\n      \"docs/plans/accounting-mission-requirements.md\",\n      \"docs/design/spec/core-contract.md\",\n      \"docs/design/chapters/06-language.tex\",\n      \"scripts/core0_ir_v1.py\"\n    ],\n    \"issues\": [],\n    \"next_actions\": [\n      \"Provide the execution inventory and authorised writable implementation environment.\",\n      \"Implement the revised plan, including actual P03-to-P04 integration tests for interior histories and overlapping conditional views.\",\n      \"Run the specified conformance and regression checks, generate both required deliverables, and submit actual results for independent review.\"\n    ],\n    \"residuals\": [\n      \"No P04 implementation or acceptance evidence exists yet; conformance.json, result.md and tests/test_accounting_p04.py remain absent.\",\n      \"Nonlinear inference, continuous probabilistic inference, unbounded integer search and arbitrary-history completeness remain outside this slice.\",\n      \"Accounting validity, empirical forecast validity and human acceptance remain unestablished; broader MC01\\u2013MC35 and G1\\u2013G18 obligations remain open.\"\n    ],\n    \"steps\": [\n      \"Verified recovery and structured records against current files.\",\n      \"Checked the focused revision against P03 semantics and applicable requirements.\",\n      \"Completed the skeptical plan audit without finding a remaining material objection.\"\n    ],\n    \"summary\": \"AGREE: the revision resolves the conditional-alternative ambiguity, preserves the parent continuous family, and specifies tests that detect accidental loss of interior histories. Numerical certification, independent oracles and incomplete-search safeguards remain explicit.\",\n    \"verdict\": \"AGREE\"\n  },\n  \"plan_hash\": \"60c9449fd1ac0201c9234bd7034e48f3cca0438041a680fd7d1930bfbd90cc93\"\n}\ndata/accounting-master/runs/20261002T221346-d54a6552/P04/execution-2/repair-2.response.json\n{\n  \"assumptions\": [\n    \"Results apply to the declared rational-linear templates, finite choices and bounded integer domains.\",\n    \"Probability support, admission provenance and grouping assumptions remain caller-supplied.\"\n  ],\n  \"checks\": [\n    \"17 P04 unittest cases passed.\",\n    \"11 P03 regression tests passed.\",\n    \"P04 checker passed all 17 catalogued obligations with no failures, errors, skips or missing observations.\",\n    \"All 384 protected files remained unchanged; 391 recorded evidence hashes matched current files.\",\n    \"Verified parent/interior preservation, conditional-query isolation, independent enumeration, strict endpoint attainment and honest incomplete-search coverage.\"\n  ],\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"scripts/rational_solver_v1.py\",\n    \"scripts/reconstruction_v1.py\",\n    \"scripts/check_accounting_p04.py\",\n    \"tests/test_accounting_p04.py\",\n    \"docs/design/spec/reconstruction-profile-v1.md\",\n    \"docs/design/fixtures/p04-reconstruction-cases-v1.json\",\n    \"data/accounting-master/deliverables/P04/conformance.json\",\n    \"data/accounting-master/deliverables/P04/result.md\",\n    \"data/accounting-master/deliverables/P04/progress.md\",\n    \"data/accounting-master/runs/20261002T221346-d54a6552/P04/phase-entry-inventory.json\"\n  ],\n  \"issues\": [],\n  \"next_actions\": [\n    \"Submit the current implementation and regenerated deliverables for independent result review.\"\n  ],\n  \"residuals\": [\n    \"Nonlinear inference, continuous probability inference, unbounded integer search, arbitrary-history completeness and general aggregation equivalence remain unsupported.\",\n    \"Accounting validity, empirical forecast validity and human acceptance remain unestablished; wider MC01\\u2013MC35 and G1\\u2013G18 obligations remain open.\"\n  ],\n  \"steps\": [\n    \"Verified recovery records against existing implementation and deliverables.\",\n    \"Repaired lossy rational conversion, malformed domains, identifier collisions, duplicate finite values and duplicate contract identities.\",\n    \"Implemented exact cardinality and lazy enumeration for very large bounded integer domains.\",\n    \"Added independent partition checks and principal/rate mutation regressions.\",\n    \"Regenerated conformance.json and result.md and finalized progress.md.\"\n  ],\n  \"summary\": \"Completed P04 recovery repairs and regenerated both required deliverables. Fresh verification passed 17 P04 tests, 11 P03 regressions and protected-file checks; independent acceptance remains pending.\",\n  \"verdict\": \"IMPLEMENTED\"\n}\ndata/accounting-master/runs/20261002T221346-d54a6552/P04/execution-2/checks.json\n{\n  \"passed\": true,\n  \"tests\": 17,\n  \"skipped\": 0,\n  \"failures\": 0,\n  \"errors\": 0,\n  \"test_file\": \"tests/test_accounting_p04.py\",\n  \"test_sha256\": \"1336dc6a60dbd1a0e765b998c9f25517797c105fd11f062ea04527e69df41b95\",\n  \"scope\": \"Engineering tests only; result review separately checks adequacy and claim limits.\"\n}\nSTRUCTURED REVIEW RECORDS\ndata/accounting-master/runs/20261002T221346-d54a6552/P04/review_plan-0.response.json\ndata/accounting-master/runs/20261002T221346-d54a6552/P04/review_plan-1.response.json\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
