closure endpoints; support exact half-even posting quantisation and bounded minor-unit symbolic cases without continuous relaxation of integers. Establish feasibility on original constraints first. For each feasible convex linear cell, optimise its closed relaxation, certify no better value, and test endpoint attainment against the original strict constraints. Record rational bounds, witnesses, proof queries, scope and rounding stage. Distinguish Unbounded from Unknown; unknown optimisation/proof/attainment checks leave the affected conclusion uncertified. Recheck source-labelled unsatisfiable cores without claiming minimality.\n6. Preserve joint queries and unfinished work. Coverage counts genuine choice/partition/integer cells, never conditional-view labels; a parent with no genuine choices has one symbolic cell despite multiple views. Each conditional query gets separate scope and coverage metadata. Record total, completed, feasible, infeasible and unresolved cells with a defined counting convention. Enforce slot, formula-size, integer-assignment, cell, solver-resource and elapsed-time limits; retain unvisited regions compactly. Feasible witnesses may coexist with PartialSearch. Infeasible requires all relevant cells proved infeasible; ExactWithinScope additionally requires all applicable obligations resolved or explicitly outside scope. Partial-cell extrema remain explored bounds. Preserve formulas and branch identities, testing joint output tuples against shared constraints.\n7. Retain bounded uncertainty, probability and resolution operations. Validate ExtractionReading, HistoricalFact, AccountingElection, MeasurementEstimate, BehaviourPolicy and FutureInnovation against required admission/provenance fields. Separate factual constraints, hypothetical stress and likelihood updates. Finite probabilities require an explicit joint measure on disjoint economic hypotheses; overlapping views are events over that measure, not additional atoms. Preserve unresolved/default mass and reject summaries requiring unavailable outcomes. Permit documented additive grouping only with retained contract memory, matching rate/reset/maturity/hedge keys and checked transition/report preservation for the requested scenario and horizon. Changed requirements force revalidation; approximate or unproved grouping remains unsupported.\n8. Implement tests/test_accounting_p04.py and independent oracles using small known-history fixtures plus selected immutable Northstar and borrowing inputs. Independently replay templates to generate observations, withholding hidden histories and authored expected constraints from production reconstruction. Compare complete finite sets and analytic continuous bounds. Include the parent/interior, isolated conditional-query and overlapping-view integration assertions listed in checks; endpoint extrema alone cannot establish preservation of the parent family. Tie every fixture obligation to executed assertions and include metamorphic input changes.\ndata/accounting-master/runs/20261002T221346-d54a6552/P04/execution-2/review_result-2.process.json\n{\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"reason\": \"timeout\",\n  \"wall_seconds\": 2.07\n}\ndata/accounting-master/runs/20261002T221346-d54a6552/P04/execution-2/review_result-2.recovery.json\n{\n  \"issues\": {\n    \"text\": \"[\\\"Command failed (timeout); inspect data/accounting-master/runs/20261002T221346-d54a6552/P04/execution-1/repair-1.log\\\"]\",\n    \"truncated\": false\n  }\n}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
